              "unitTitle": "让计划依据观察前进，而不是在反复规划中空转",
              "sectionTitle": "1 三种策略改变的是控制对象",
              "title": "1 三种策略改变的是控制对象",
              "reason": "根据职业知识语义定位到当前教材原文。",
              "evidenceExcerpt": "仍用“解释失败报告并形成有证据的缺陷说明”，设一开始只知道 report-71。",
              "sourcePath": "textbooks/v12/n03-planning-reflection.md",
              "sourceSha256": "76b919dbb061348a5bc59b958f714a9fff814be618d390be48eba098751372dd",
              "version": "textbook-v12",
              "href": "#learn/agent/n03-planning-reflection/s-da63f3dcff17",
              "intentId": "dialog_semantic_topic",
              "matchingBasis": "local_semantic_topic",
              "matchedSourceTerms": [],
              "prerequisiteUnitIds": [
